WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Start PCRC on Windows, compare the pairing codes, and keep the selected computer online.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Open Connectors, choose Add custom > MCP server, and enter the PCRC server URL.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Choose OAuth and Add & authorize. Sign in to the account that owns the computer.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Use PCRC in project chat. Try a read-only request and check the result.
